Package: VarDistPlots
Type: Package
Title: Compare the Distributions of Several Variables
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: person("Herman", "Elgueta", email = "hermanelgueta@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A jamovi module to compare the distributions of several numeric,
    ordinal or nominal variables side by side on a shared scale, with a choice
    of plots (box, violin, means with error bars, raincloud, ridgeline,
    histogram, density, ECDF, stacked and diverging bars, heatmap, waffle and more).
License: GPL (>= 2)
Imports:
    jmvcore (>= 0.8.6),
    R6,
    ggplot2 (>= 3.4.0),
    scales,
    viridisLite
Encoding: UTF-8
